6.5}, {"t": 147.228, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 147.0}, {"t": 147.728, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 147.5}, {"t": 148.228, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 148.0}, {"t": 148.668, "kind": "inputTranscription", "text": "して 富裕 層 だけ で なく 、 一 サラリーマン で も 郊外 に 家 を 持てる よう に なり 、 郊外 から 電車 に 乗っ て 会社 へ 通勤 する と いう ライフ スタイル が 定着 し 、 安定 し た 乗客 数 を 見込める よう に なっ た 。"}, {"t": 148.729, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 148.5}, {"t": 148.908, "kind": "outputTranscription", "text": "是銀行員的小林獨有的點子。不只富裕階級，一般上班族也能在郊區擁有自己的房子，從郊區搭電車通勤到公司的生活方式也因此固定下來，使得乘客數量變得穩定。"}, {"t": 148.908, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 17960}, {"t": 148.928, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 10240}, {"t": 148.982, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 12800}, {"t": 149.022, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 10240}, {"t": 149.077, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 12800}, {"t": 149.152, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 15360}, {"t": 149.219, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 17920}, {"t": 149.228, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 149.0}, {"t": 149.26, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 10240}, {"t": 149.383, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 28160}, {"t": 149.504, "kind": "turnComplete"}, {"t": 149.729, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 149.5}, {"t": 150.228, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 150.0}, {"t": 150.728, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 150.5}, {"t": 151.229, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 151.0}, {"t": 151.728, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 151.5}, {"t": 152.228, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 152.0}, {"t": 152.728, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 152.5}, {"t": 153.228, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 153.0}, {"t": 153.728, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 153.5}, {"t": 154.228, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 154.0}, {"t": 154.728, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 154.5}, {"t": 155.228, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 155.0}, {"t": 155.728, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 155.5}, {"t": 156.228, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 156.0}, {"t": 156.728, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 156.5}, {"t": 157.227, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 157.0}, {"t": 157.727, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 157.5}, {"t": 158.227, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 157.894}, {"t": 158.584, "kind": "